<h3 id=3D"endpoints-and-data-models">Endpoints and data models</h3>
<p>Now that we've chosen our communication protocol and data format, let's =
dive into the specific endpoints and data models we'll need.</p>
<h4 id=3D"client-initiated-requests">Client-initiated requests</h4>
<p>For sending messages, we can define the following endpoint:</p>
<pre><code>Authentication: Bearer &lt;token&gt;
POST /v1/messages
  Body: NewMessageRequest
  Response: 201 Created. Payload of type NewMessageResponse
</code></pre>
<br>
