;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a system architecture diagram for a messagi=
ng application.  The diagram shows data flow between several components.  A=
t the bottom, a 'Chats DB' database is accessed by two Data Access Objects =
(DAOs): 'Message Request DAO' and 'Message DAO,' which interact with a 'Mes=
